Today I am very happy.
I now have a new phone number.
I stop near a stall.
There is a lot of crowd here.
I look at the vendor.
I say, "Bhaiya, one vada pav and one cutting chai."
Bhaiya asks, "Madam, spicy?"
I say, "Less spicy, bhaiya."
Bhaiya gives me the vada pav.
He also gives me tea.
I have a hot vada pav.
The vada pav is very tasty.
I drink the hot tea.
I like Mumbai's food very much.
I ask, "Bhaiya, how many rupees?"
Bhaiya says, "Thirty rupees, madam."
I give thirty rupees to bhaiya.
I say, "Thank you, bhaiya."
I feel very good.
